---
import SideBarFooter from "./SideBarFooter.astro";
import SideBarMenu from "./SideBarMenu.astro";
const { sideBarActiveItemID } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="drawer-side z-40">
  <label for="my-drawer" class="drawer-overlay"></label>
  <aside class="px-4 pt-6 h-auto min-h-full w-[19rem] bg-base-200 text-base-content flex flex-col border-r border-base-300">
    <!-- Logo + Brand -->
    <a href="/" class="group block mb-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">
        <img
          src="/upwise_logo.png"
          alt="UPWISE logo"
          width="60"
          height="60"
          class="rounded-lg shadow-lg"
        />
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-content">
            UP<span class="text-primary">WISE</span><span class="text-primary">.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-base-content/60 tracking-widest uppercase mt-0.5">
            GIS Instructor
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Tagline -->
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed px-1 mb-6 mt-3">
      실무 중심 GIS 교육으로<br />지리정보의 가치를 높입니다.
    </p>

    <div class="divider my-0 opacity-30"></div>

    <SideBarMenu sideBarActiveItemID={sideBarActiveItemID} />
    <SideBarFooter />
  </aside>
</div>
